#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>Keyboard Layout</h1> Here you can choose your keyboard layout and "
#~ "model. The 'model' refers to the type of keyboard that is connected to "
#~ "your computer, while the keyboard layout defines \"which key does what\" "
#~ "and may be different for different countries."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Klavijaturnyja vykłady</h1> Tut ty možaš vybrać sabie madel "
#~ "klavijatury j vykład klavišaŭ. Vykład aznačaje, jakim dziejańniam "
#~ "adpaviadajuć klavišy tvajoj klavijatury. Dla roznych krajoŭ jany mohuć "
#~ "być roznymi."

#~ msgid "Keyboard &model:"
#~ msgstr "&Madel klavijatury:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your "
#~ "keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your "
#~ "keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer "
#~ "usually have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, "
#~ "which is probably what you want if you do not know what kind of keyboard "
#~ "you have.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Tut možna vybrać madel klavijatury. Hetaja nałada nie zaležyć ad vykładaŭ "
#~ "klavišaŭ i adpaviadaje typu klavijatury, jakaja lažyć pierad taboj. "
#~ "Sučasnyja klavijatury zvyčajna majuć dźvie dadatkovyja klavišy. Ich jašče "
#~ "nazyvajuć „104-klavišnymi”. Kali ty nia viedaješ, što abrać, vybiery "
#~ "hetuju madel.\n"

